<title>UK: OPEC basket price dipped to $18.49 on Thursday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price dipped to $18.49 on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes  eased to $18.49 a barrel on Thursday, from $18.57 on Wednesday, the  OPEC news agency said, quoting the OPEC Secretariat.</p>
<p>The basket comprises Algeria's Saharan Blend, Indonesia's Minas, Nigeria's  Bonny Light, Saudi Arabia's Arabian Light, Dubai of the UAE, Venezuela's  Tia Juana and Mexico's Isthmus.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
